# Paths used by vlog, vsim, and vsyn. Paths are from the repo root.
# First word is the key. Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
# incdir: directories searched for `include "params.sv" (sim define files).
# rtl/params.sv is the package. It is compiled from the file list, not included.
# params: generated defines files written on CAD. Sim and syn keep these.
# A design name is the file list for that top. Keep rtl/params.sv first.

